        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Being attracted to energy of the same attunement, the Coalescence unerringly moves towards the dragon it is attuned to.</p><p>The Coalescence loses all movement-impairing effects and then flies 25 feet toward the dragon it is currently attuned to. As a being of pure energy, it can move through the space of other creatures and Fjordcarver's stalactites, but it can not pass through any other physical barriers.</p><p>This movement ignores Difficult Terrain and similar effects that would increase the movement cost of a square it passed through, and does not count as a Move action for the purpose of triggering reactions.</p>"
        },
