        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The energy of the Coalescence resonates with Ashgut and Fjordcarver. Regardless of its initiative roll, it always acts immediately before Ashgut. If another creature delays their turn to go in between the Coalescence and Ashgut, Ashgut takes her turn first and that creature's initiative is delayed until after Ashgut (And Fjordcarver). If a player's initiative would change to force them between the Coalescence and Ashgut (such as from being knocked unconscious) the player should move above the Coalescence instead.</p>"
