        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The Coalescence shares a square with a dragon it is not attuned to.</p><hr /><p>The opposing primal energies of the Coalescence and the dragon clash violently, dealing @Damage[2d12+15] untyped damage to the dragon with a Basic Reflex Save. On a failure, they are also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p><p>The clash of energies then rebounds on the Coalescence, immediately triggering Elemental Attunement.</p><p><strong>Special:</strong> The DC of this save depends on how Slam Dunk was triggered.</p><p>If it was moved with an Athletics check, use the Athletics DC of the creature moving it.</p><p>If it was moved by a spell, use the appropriate Spell DC.</p><p>If it was moved by a different effect, use an appropriate statistic of the responsible creature, or the Reflex DC of the Energy Coalescence otherwise.</p>"
        },
        "frequency": {
          "max": 1,
          "per": "round"
        },
