          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The Coalescence shares a square with a dragon it is attuned to.</p><hr /><p>The matching primal energies of the Coalescence empower the triggering dragon and heal their wounds.</p><p>The dragon becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} for one round and gains 30 Temporary Hit Points that last for one minute.</p><p>They can use their Quickened action only to Stride, Strike, or use their gaze attack.</p>"
