        "category": "defensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>As a being of pure energy, the Energy Coalescence is neither dead nor alive.</p><p>It is permanently @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed}, can only use its actions for Elemental Freedom and Elemental Attraction in this order, and it is immune to any effects that would further alter the number of actions it receives at the start of its turn.</p><p>It can be considered to be an object or a creature for the purpose of targeting, whichever would be more beneficial for the creature targeting it. At the GM's discretion, it may also be considered a willing creature for the purpose of targeting.</p><p>It is immune to all damage, death effects, and the Prone condition.</p>"
        },
