        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Coalesence purifies its essence, cleansing itself from all negative effects (Except Slowed from Metaphysical Form).</p><p>If the Coalescence was @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} before using this ability, reduce its speeds by 5 feet for the remainder of this turn.</p><p>If the Coalesence was @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} before using this ability, reduce its speeds by 10 feet for the remainder of this turn.</p><p>Other movement-impairing effects may reduce the movement speed by up to 10 feet at the GM's discretion.</p>"
